# Virtual course for the firmware simulator. Units: metres, degrees.
# Commands:
#   size W H                     floor size (x right, y up)
#   border                       walls around the floor
#   rounded_border R             same, with corner radius R
#   start X Y HEADING_DEG        robot start pose (0 = facing +x, CCW positive)
#   line WIDTH x1 y1 x2 y2 ...   tape polyline
#   stadium CX CY STRAIGHT RADIUS WIDTH   closed oval tape loop
#   box X0 Y0 X1 Y1 [name]       rectangular obstacle
#   circle CX CY R [name]        round obstacle
#   wall X0 Y0 X1 Y1 [name]      thin wall
# Practice loop, NOT the official course (see course.world, from the handout).
size 3.0 2.0
border
stadium 1.5 1.0 1.4 0.5 0.05
start 1.2 0.5 0
